; Reconcile (R1 to R3): a January statement for Checking. Cleared (*) up to Jan 31: 800.00. Two
; purchases are still pending (!), and one after the statement date. tests/reconcile.rs
; reconciles it; reconciled.bean is the result.
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2026-01-01 open Assets:Checking USD
  budget: "on"
2026-01-01 open Income:Salary USD
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Food USD
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Rent USD

2026-01-02 * "Paycheck"
  Assets:Checking  2000.00 USD
  Income:Salary

2026-01-10 ! "Corner Shop"
  Expenses:Food  45.20 USD
  Assets:Checking

2026-01-15 * "Landlord"
  Expenses:Rent  1200.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2026-01-29 ! "Market"
  Expenses:Food  30.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2026-02-03 ! "Cafe"
  Expenses:Food  8.50 USD
  Assets:Checking
